B.1 Source and Authority

The text below is reproduced from the Code of Federal Regulations, Title 22, Chapter I, Subchapter M, Part 120, Subpart C, Section 120.41, as published in the Federal Register and compiled by the U.S. Government Publishing Office.  This is the operative text for determining whether a part or component is “specially designed” for a defense article and therefore subject to ITAR control.

